    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, disciplined cyan/green/yellow accents, clear decision hierarchy, and a well-structured evidence card across all viewports. However, desktop has excessive empty space between the hero and artifact, the mobile layout becomes a very long stack with weak row density, and the translucent global header allows oversized underlying text to visibly collide with navigation. Several tiny, low-contrast mono labels also reduce polish and legibility.",
